---
to: "generated/scim/lifecycle_operations.md"
force: true
sparql:
  operations: |
    PREFIX scim: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/scim-lifecycle#>
    PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
    PREFIX dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
    SELECT ?op ?kind ?resourceClass ?description
    WHERE {
      ?opIri a scim:LifecycleOperation ;
             scim:operationKind ?kindIri ;
             scim:targetsResourceClass ?rc .
      ?kindIri skos:notation ?kind .
      BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?opIri), "#") AS ?op)
      BIND(STRAFTER(STR(?rc), "#") AS ?resourceClass)
      OPTIONAL { ?opIri dcterms:description ?description }
    }
    ORDER BY ?resourceClass ?kind ?op
---
# SCIM lifecycle operations

Generated by `scim-lifecycle-pack`. Each row is a `scim:LifecycleOperation`
(prov:Activity subclass). Declaring an operation admits the protocol verb as
an observed activity class — it does **not** authorize provisioning.

| Operation | Kind | Resource | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
{% for row in operations %}| `{{ row.op }}` | {{ row.kind }} | {{ row.resourceClass }} | {{ row.description | default(value="") }} |
{% endfor %}
